      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'll elaborate a bit more on the suggestion. This person wants to be able to detect when your avatar is leaving the world and drive logic based on that.\n\nI don't know how feasible that would be, assuming the avatar gets unloaded the second you leave. But having a parameter for that and being able to leave behind an animation for a few seconds could be nice.",
